   "sourceHash": "3db723cd60d423331046b875cdb08993a9e7efe9a643745cdab7f8b288cbad5c",
   "text": "रसायन (कायाकल्प) उपचारों के लिए उत्कृष्ट",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
